hadiths[18]{hadithnumber,text}:
"76","[AI-translation] Abu Dardaa se riwayat hai, Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Kya tum mein se kisi ko ye mushkil hai ke woh ek raat mein Qur'an ka teesra hissa padh le? Unhon ne arz kiya: Aur Qur'an ka teesra hissa kaise padha jaye? Aapne farmaya: ""Qul huwal lahu ahad"" Qur'an ke teesre hisse ke barabar hai."
"77","[AI-translation] Abu Saeed Khudri se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne ek shakhs ko ""Qul huwal lahu ahad"" padhte hue suna jo usay baar baar padh raha tha. Phir jab subah hui toh woh Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki khidmat mein aaya aur yeh baat zikr ki. Aur goya us shakhs ne isay kam samjha. Toh Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Us Zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai, yeh waqai Qur'an ke teesre hisse ke barabar hai."
"78","[AI-translation] Aur Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah ne hamein hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Hamein Affaan ne hadees bayan ki, unhone kaha: Hamein Abaan Al-Attaar ne hadees bayan ki, yeh sab Qataadah se, isi isnaad ke saath. Aur un dono ki hadees mein Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke qaul ka hissa hai ke aapne farmaya: Allah ne Qur'an ko teen hisson mein taqseem kiya aur ""Qul huwal lahu ahad"" ko Qur'an ke hisson mein se ek hissa muqarar kiya."
"79","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah se riwayat hai, unhone kaha ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Jama ho jao kyunke main tumhein Qur'an ka teesra hissa padh kar sunaunga. Toh jama ho gaye jo jama hua. Phir Nabi Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bahar tashreef laye aur ""Qul huwal lahu ahad"" padhi, phir andar tashreef le gaye. Toh hum mein se baaz ne baaz se kaha: Mujhe lagta hai yeh koi khabar hai jo aasman se aayi hai jis ki wajah se andar gaye. Phir Nabi Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) bahar tashreef laye aur farmaya: Maine tum se kaha tha ke main tumhein Qur'an ka teesra hissa padh kar sunaunga, aagah raho ke yeh Qur'an ke teesre hisse ke barabar hai."
"80","[AI-translation] Anas se riwayat hai ke ek shakhs ne arz kiya: Ya Rasoolullah! Mujhe yeh surah (Qul huwal lahu ahad) mehboob hai. Toh Aapne farmaya: Tumhari is surah ki muhabbat tumhein jannat mein dakhil karegi."
"81","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah farmate hain ke main Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke saath aa raha tha, to aap ne ek shakhs ko padhte hue suna: ""Qul huwal lahu ahad, Allahus samad"". To Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: ""Wajabat"". Maine arz kiya: ""Aur kya wajib ho gaya?"" Farmaya: ""Jannat""."
"82","[AI-translation] Aisha se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek shakhs ko ek sariyyah par bheja. Wo apne saathiyon ki namaz mein unhein tilawat karte aur Qul huwal lahu ahad se khatam karte. Phir jab wo laut aaye to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke samne iska zikr kiya gaya. Aapne farmaya: ""Unse poocho ke wo aisa kis cheez ki wajah se karte hain?"" Unse poocha gaya to unhone kaha: ""Kyunke ye Rahman ki sifat hai aur mujhe isey padhna mehboob hai."" To Rasoolullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: ""Unhein khabar kar do ke Allah unhein mehboob rakhta hai."
"83","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne tawaf ki do rak'aton mein Ikhlas ki do suratein: (Qul ya ayyuhal kafiroon) aur (Qul huwallahu ahad) padhi."
"84","[AI-translation] Ubayy bin Ka'b se riwayat hai, kehte hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Witr ki pehli rak'at mein ""Sabbih isma Rabbika al-A'la"", aur dusri mein ""Qul ya ayyuha al-kafirun"", aur teesri mein ""Qul huwa Allahu ahad"" padhte the."
"85","[AI-translation] Abu Hurayrah se riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam Fajr ki do rak'aton mein ""Qul ya ayyuha al-kafirun"" aur ""Qul huwa Allahu ahad"" padhte the."
"86","[AI-translation] Hazrat Aisha se riwayat hai ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab har raat apne bistar par aate to apne dono haathon ko jama karte, phir un mein dam karte aur un mein (Qul huwallahu ahad) aur (Qul a'uzu birabbil falaq) aur (Qul a'uzu birabbin naas) padhte, phir un se apne jism ka jitna hissa mumkin ho mas karte, apne sar aur chehre aur jism ke aage ke hisse se shuru karte, yeh kaam teen baar karte."
"87","[AI-translation] Mu'az bin Abdullah bin Khubaib ne apne waalid se riwayat kiya, kaha: Hum ek barsaati aur gehri andheri raat mein nikle, Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ko talashte the ke humare liye namaz padhein. Kaha: Main unhein paas gaya. Unhone kaha: ""Kaho."" Maine kuch nahi kaha. Phir farmaya: ""Kaho."" Maine kuch nahi kaha. Farmaya: ""Kaho."" Maine poocha: ""Kya kahun?"" Farmaya: ""Kaho: (Qul huwallahu ahad) aur Mu'awwizatain ko jab shaam ho aur subah ho teen baar padho, yeh tumhe har cheez se kafi hai."
"88","[AI-translation] Haddasana Abdullah bin Yusuf, akhbarana Malik, Ibn Shihab se, Urwa se, Aisha radiyallahu anha se, ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam jab bimar hote to apne upar Mu'awwizat padhte aur phoonk maarte. Jab unka dard shiddat ko pahuncha to main un par padhti aur unke haath se mas karti, unki barkat ki umeed mein."
"89","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir se riwayat hai, kehate hain ke mujhe Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne hukm diya ke main har namaz ke baad Mu'awwizat padhoon."
"90","[AI-translation] Uqba bin Aamir se riwayat hai, kehate hain ke Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tumne un aayaat ko nahi dekha jo aaj raat nazil hui hain, jin ke jaisi kabhi nahi dekhi gayi: (Qul a'uzu birabbil falaq) aur (Qul a'uzu birabbin naas)."
"91","[AI-translation] 'Uqbah bin 'Amir riwayat karte hain, kehte hain: Maine Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ki tabi'at ki, Aap sawaar thay. To maine apna haath Aap ke qadme par rakh diya aur arz kiya: Mujhe Surah Hud aur Surah Yusuf padha dijiye, aye Rasoolullah! Aap ne farmaya: Tum Allah ke nazdeek is se zyada behtar koi cheez nahi padhoge: (Qul a'oodhu bi-Rabbil-Falaq) aur (Qul a'oodhu bi-Rabbin-Naas)."
"92","[AI-translation] Abu Sa'id riwayat karte hain, kehte hain: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) jinnon aur insaan ki nazar se panaah maange (panaah talab farma) te. Yahan tak ke Mu'awwidhatain nazil hueen. Phir jab wo nazil hueen, Aap ne unhein ikhtiyaar farma liya aur un ke siwa baaki sab ko chohr diya."
"93","[AI-translation] Hamein Mahmud bin Khalid ne khabar di, kehte hain: Hamein Walid ne hadees bayaan ki, kehte hain: Hamein Abu 'Amr ne bayaan ki, Yahya se, woh Muhammad bin Ibrahim bin Haris se. Abu 'Abdullah ne mujhe khabar di ke Ibn 'Abis al-Juhani ne unhein khabar di ke Rasoolullah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne un se farmaya: Aye Ibn 'Abis! Kya main tumhein — ya Aap ne farmaya kya main tumhein khabar du — panaah maangne walon ki behtareen cheez ki taraf daleel du? Unhone arz kiya: Balay, aye Rasoolullah! Aap ne farmaya: (Qul a'oodhu bi-Rabbil-Falaq) aur (Qul a'oodhu bi-Rabbin-Naas) ye dono Surahen."
